        "node_id": "n_1_35166a",
        "thought_text": "The current approach greedily assigns heroes to towns based on immediate gains, which can lead to suboptimal solutions. A more effective strategy is to consider the cumulative impact of heroes on monsters, allowing for a more balanced distribution of their abilities across towns.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
