        "node_id": "n_2_29c53c",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach had a logical error in the dynamic programming state transition. Instead of considering the cumulative maximum number of monsters defeated, it should have considered the maximum number of monsters defeated up to each hero, which allows for more flexibility in choosing which monsters each hero should defeat. This requires a different dynamic programming formulation that considers the optimal choices for each hero independently.",
